{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted"],"title":"Quickstart","anchor":"Quickstart"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest"],"title":"How-to Guides","anchor":"How-to-Guides"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference"],"title":"Reference","anchor":"Reference"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ValueTranslation"],"title":"Explanation","anchor":"Explanation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService"],"title":"Service Layer","anchor":"Service-Layer"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"],"title":"Testing","anchor":"Testing"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","role":"collection","title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)"},{"type":"text","text":" calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mixpanel.initialize"},{"type":"text","text":" internally so apps never need to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"type":"text","text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the bridge between Mixpanel’s iOS SDK and Swidux’s provider-agnostic analytics plugin. The plugin owns analytics state (opt-out flag, current screen, last-identified user) and converts your domain actions into typed ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" values; this package translates those events into Mixpanel SDK calls and maps ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" into Mixpanel’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Properties","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" payload.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two types ship in a single product:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the live "},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer that constructs and wraps a "},{"code":"MixpanelInstance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — a recording actor for SwiftUI "},{"code":"#Preview","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks and Swift Testing suites."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The flow:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["store.send(.counter(.increment(5)))","  → AnalyticsPlugin runs the mapper in afterReduce","  → mapper emits AnalyticsEvent(\"counter_added\", [\"amount\": .int(5)])","  → MixpanelAnalyticsService.track(_:) forwards to MixpanelInstance.track(event:properties:)","  → Mixpanel SDK queues the event and flushes per its own schedule"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The plugin and the adapter stay decoupled: the plugin doesn’t know about Mixpanel, and the adapter doesn’t know about your action tree.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/GettingStarted":{"title":"Getting Started with SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted","abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, build ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/ServiceReference":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"API reference for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the Mixpanel-backed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer that the analytics plugin consumes."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/servicereference","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ServiceReference","title":"Service Reference","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/ValueTranslation":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","title":"V